      "title": "Shanthi Gears' (NSE:SHANTIGEAR) Problems Go Beyond Weak Profit",
      "body": "The market wasn't impressed with the soft earnings from Shanthi Gears Limited ( NSE:SHANTIGEAR ) recently. Our analysis...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/capital-goods/nse-shantigear/shanthi-gears-shares/news/shanthi-gears-nseshantigear-problems-go-beyond-weak-profit",
